id: efficient
name: Efficient
kind: crafting
weaponType: energy
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Attacks with it cost 2(T) Ki less, and with the Simple Profile they are 2(T) higher on the
  Wound Roll.
text: >
  Efficient: This Weapon is easy to use, allowing for the user to expend less energy.
  –Effects: Attacking Maneuvers made using this Weapon have their Ki Point Cost reduced by 2(T).
  Additionally, increase the Wound Rolls of Attacking Maneuvers made with the Simple Profile by
  2(T).

---

# The Minimum Ki Point Cost still holds under it, as under every reduction. `$simple` is 1 for
# an attack of the Simple Profile.
[passive]
weapon.kiCost -= 2(T);
weapon.wound += 2(T) * $simple;
